    },
    {
      "text": "in the end you get this beautiful typed event log, which gives you replays. It gives you rollbacks and it gives you forks.",
      "timestamp_sec": 223,
      "why": "States the concrete payoff of event sourcing for agents."
    },
    {
      "text": "this is not a harness. It's it's a runtime and you can actually rebuild most of the common harnesses on top of it.",
