    },
    {
      "text": "It is much more complex about actually pretty unintuitive. I would never write code myself with ActoGraph, but again, AI seems really good at it.",
      "timestamp_sec": 393,
      "why": "Rare admission of a real ergonomic tradeoff, and a bet on AI-authored code."
    },
    {
      "text": "it's inspired by uh blackboard architecture from the '70s or '80s or more recently Kafka, whole bunch of micro workers communicating through a shared state",
      "timestamp_sec": 430,
